     "exampleMeaning": "I have a stomachache."
    },
    {
     "id": "c09-d1-i5",
     "text": "o pé",
     "meaning": "the foot",
     "example": "Meu pé está machucado.",
     "exampleMeaning": "My foot is hurt."
